=== Budget Planning Tool ===

# Budget Performance Analysis & Forecast

## 1. SPENDING PACE VS. TIMELINE ASSESSMENT

| Category | Budget | Spent | % of Budget | Expected at 33% | Status |
|----------|--------|-------|------------|-----------------|--------|
| **Marketing** | $50,000 | $35,000 | 70% | $16,500 | ⚠️ AHEAD |
| **R&D** | $100,000 | $60,000 | 60% | $33,000 | ⚠️ AHEAD |
| **Operations** | $75,000 | $55,000 | 73% | $24,750 | ⚠️ AHEAD |
| **TOTAL** | $300,000 | $150,000 | 50% | $99,000 | ⚠️ AHEAD |

**Key Finding:** All categories are spending **50-73% faster** than the timeline suggests. At this pace, the budget will be exhausted by month 8-9 instead of month 12.

---

## 2. OVER/UNDER BUDGET ANALYSIS

### Overspending Categories (Priority Order)

**🔴 CRITICAL: Operations (+$30,250 variance)**
- Spending at 73% of budget with only 33% of year elapsed
- Projected overrun: **$51,750** (69% over budget)
- Likely causes: Unexpected maintenance, staffing costs, utilities


